+Feature: DOM element identity preservation on toggle
+  As a developer
+  I want DOM elements to retain their identity when todo state changes
+  So that browser-based tests and event handlers have stable references
+
+  @contract
+  Scenario: The toggle-todo seam preserves element identity
+    Given the toggle-todo source at "js/app.js"
+    When the verifier checks the toggle-todo seam against the scantling at "assets/toggle-identity-scantling.json"
+    Then no counterexample is found
